<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-CUPER JOINS NEW BRIGADE IN SPAIN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CUPER JOINS NEW BRIGADE IN SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentinian Hector Cuper was announced as Real Mallorca's new coach on Thursday.</p>
<p>Cuper is joining the newly promoted side from the Lanus club in his native Argentina.</p>
<p>He is the ninth new coach to be named by clubs in the 20-team Spanish first division since their domestic season finished on June 23.</p>
<p>Cuper's predecessor, Tomeu Llompart, is likely to stay with the club in another coaching capacity.</p>
